<td id="A2.T4.4.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="4"><span id="A2.T4.4.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof-Style</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T4.4.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T4.4.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt">All-Russian Olympiad of Schoolchildren</td>
